      "id": 229193,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-11-13T03:17:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That said, there's flexibility.&nbsp; If his schtick is \"this quarterstaff is my ancestral weapon, I have practiced with it until it is like an extension of my own body, but give me a spear and I'm completely useless\" then by all means go with Signature Weapon.&nbsp; If he's a martial arts practictioner who favors the quarterstaff but could use other things in a pinch, another Power might be more appropriate.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:52.834Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
