    {
      "id": 229194,
      "name": "catDreaming",
      "username": "catDreaming",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-11-13T04:57:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Or, run back a mix of the two. If he's especially practiced, or almost always seen with that quarterstaff, then Signature Weapon is an easy pick.</p>\n<p>If Super Quarterstaff Guy often incorporates his Agility into how he is a hero, or in how he fights in general, then you could also easy pick Agility.</p>\n<p>It's really a case of how you see them being a hero, even beyond situations where they are beating someone unconscious with the quarterstaff.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:52.901Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
